  "response_text": "All tools registered on your MCP server are currently approved. The server has 25 tools in total, and each one is active and available for use.\n\nRegarding the kinds of tasks I can assist with: I can help manage and interact with robotic or automated systems by planning actions, perceiving environments, executing physical or manipulation tasks, and handling low-level control commands. I can also provide environmental data like weather and temperature, manage tool registration and metadata, assess authorization for actions, and handle time-related queries. Additionally, I can simulate or inject state information for testing or planning purposes, read sensor data such as LiDAR scans and robot joint states, and publish messages to control buses. My capabilities span administrative functions, real-time system interaction, perception, planning, and execution within a managed robotic framework—continuously evaluating how these functions might apply to evolving scenarios without concluding definitively on any single interpretation or application.",
